---
import ProductLayout from '../../layouts/ProductLayout.astro';
import Video from '../../components/Video.astro';

---
<ProductLayout
  slug="jdel"
  section="playground"
  eyebrow="Passion project · Beauty"
  title="JDel"
  tagline="The perfume brand I’ve dreamed about since I was a kid, <strong>named for my mom and me</strong>."
  hero="/images/jdel/bottle.webp"
  heroAlt="Amber glass perfume bottle with a gold cap, pearl collar, woven leather handle, and a JDel hang tag on draped satin"
  summary={[
    ['The idea', 'A <strong>fragrance brand</strong>: elegant, timeless, warm.'],
    ['What I did', '<strong>Brand</strong>, <strong>palette</strong>, <strong>type</strong>, and prompts.'],
    ['The tool', '<strong>AI image generation</strong>, steered by my design choices.'],
  ]}
>
  <section class="chapter">
    <span class="num">Why this brand</span>
    <p class="pull">“My mom’s perfume collection made me feel like a <span class="hl">kid in a candy store</span>.”</p>
    <p>A kokeshi doll, a high heel, a cat, an Eiffel Tower. Every empty bottle joined my <strong>Barbie collection</strong>.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="chapter tinted">
    <span class="num">01 · The name</span>
    <h2>Her name and mine.</h2>
    <p>That childhood game became a hobby: <strong>layering scents</strong> by season. Then a dream. <strong>JDel</strong> blends my name with my mom’s, a tribute to the women who made me who I am.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="chapter">
    <span class="num">02 · The process</span>
    <h2>Design first, then prompt.</h2>
    <p>I picked the <strong>palette</strong> and <strong>typography</strong> by hand, wrote them into my prompts, and varied them until the renders felt <strong>luxury</strong>.</p>
    <div class="band pal-vid"><Video name="jdel-palette" label="JDel brand palette card with six warm brown swatches, followed by a bottle sketch" caption="Palette card and first sketch" /></div>
    <div class="learn"><b>What I learned</b><p>AI is a tool. The taste still has to come from me.</p></div>
  </section>

  <section class="chapter">
    <span class="num">Next chapter</span>
    <h2>ReLeaf first. JDel someday.</h2>
    <p>For now, <a href="/projects/releaf">ReLeaf Candles</a> is the first chapter. One day, <strong>JDel will be real too</strong>.</p>
  </section>
</ProductLayout>

<style>
  .chapter > .band.pal-vid { max-width: 440px; }
</style>
